# permit-rulebook needs no secrets today. If one ever appears, it goes in .env
# (gitignored), gets a line here with a placeholder, and never lands in git.
#
# One optional variable, and it is not a secret: where the built site will
# live. Every absolute URL a link preview reads — the canonical, the OG url,
# the social card — follows it. Unset, the build uses the domain the identity
# mock shows in its preview.
#
# SITE_URL=https://permitrulebook.com
